{"id": 14651, "group": "american-express-oa", "sent_at": "2026-10-27T18:48:26.40532+00:00", "text": "amex ds & analytics\n3 sections the, teeno mei +1, -0.25\n1. numerical ability (17 ques, 23 mins) - heavy on mean, median, mode (at least my paper) along with a few easy probability ques\n2. lr/di (16 ques, 22 mins) - mostly graph based ques, very low on logical reasoning wala part but jitne the easy the\n3. tech (12 ques, 15 mins) - mostly prompt engg k upar ques the ki prompt kaisa hona chahiye, 2 sql k mcq aur 2 python mcq\nkaafi ques galat the section 1 and 2 mei, options match nhi kr rhe the type", "author_tag": "IITH", "reply_to": {"id": 14468, "text": "Amex OAs question paper?", "author_tag": "IITK"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
